<https://ovillo.sophia-labs.com/id/piece/gigante-y-juguete> <http://sophia.ai/ovillo#note> "One tune in canon on two guitar-shaped worlds: a giant tuned an octave down and a toy tuned a fourth up. A toy tuned a full octave up was refused by the engine: its 24th partial at the 12th fret would sit at 23 kHz, past the band." .
